auth/HTTPS precondition for it and does not name how the backtest script reaches Gerrit. The repo's existing Gerrit client (src/rebar/review_bot/gerrit_client.py) reaches ChangeInfo only via the authenticated `/a/` namespace using HTTP basic auth (BOT_USER:GERRIT_BOT_TOKEN); a measurement script — which the plan otherwise emphasizes running offline — has no such credentials by default.","group_criteria":null,"group_id":null,"id":"f516e82f14b9a1d6c","impact":0.536,"is_primary":null,"location":"Approach → Read (a), 'patchset count from Gerrit o=ALL_REVISIONS ... the only one requiring the network'","norm_id":"na70ca19449e87b4b","priority":0.3752,"reason":"default-advisory","recalled":false,"scenarios":["Script run in CI or by a reviewer without GERRIT_BOT_TOKEN cannot fetch patchset counts, silently dropping the patchset-count variable or erroring","AC2 reproducibility: re-running the documented command offline cannot reproduce the Gerrit-derived column"],"severity":null,"suggested_fix":"In Read (a), name that the patchset count reuses src/rebar/review_bot/gerrit_client.py (authenticated `/a/changes/{id}?o=ALL_REVISIONS`, HTTP basic auth via BOT_USER:GERRIT_BOT_TOKEN), and state the behavior when those credentials are unset (e.g. the variable is reported as N/A with n stated for the columns that are computable offline).","tier":"LLM","validity":0.7,"verification":{"binary":{"absence_confirmed_in_context":"yes","asserted_capability_confirmed":"yes","cited_reference_accurate":"yes","claims_absence":"yes","committed_work_relies_on_unbacked_claim":"yes","current_state_satisfies_plan_goal":"na","evidence_entails_finding":"yes","impact_follows_necessarily":"no","is_verifiable":"yes","no_existing_mitigation":"yes","no_viable_alternative_explanation":"no","path_reachable":"yes","prerequisite_attribution_valid":"na","respects_artifact_altitude":"no","severity_claim_justified":"yes"},"severity_attributes":{"ac_unverifiable":"none","blast_radius":"local","debt_impact":"medium","